<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>
      <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0">IN WITNESS WHEREOF, Borrower has caused this Note to be duly executed as of the Effective
         Date.</P>


      <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>
